OK, here's a bad bug for everybody to try out in wizard mode...


Possible spoilers


I (neutral priest) got to the lava pits of Nalzok and started hacking up
his buddies.  Later, I start on Nalzok, and he reproduces himself rapidly.
I keep at him with Vorpy and eventually decapitate three Nalzoks, upon
which I find three cursed silver bells.  I pick one up, then the other.

Suddenly, I get a message to the effect of

Already has silver bell?
Program in disorder - perhaps you should quit?

Nothing bad happens, but I keep playing.  Hopefully I won't get screwed
out of a good game.

BTW, I ended up with 500 hps after cleaning out the graveyard area leading
to Nalzok's lava pits.  You definitely need stealth in order to control
your enemies in the graveyard.  So ditch that cloak of displacement in 
favor of that nice elven cloak for the graveyards and morgues.

